    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>Sphalerite</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>Calamine</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>Galena</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ZnCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>Siderite</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnS</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>",
